<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY AGENCY TO PAY HUF5.281 BLN TO TVK.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY AGENCY TO PAY HUF5.281 BLN TO TVK.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's privatisation agency APV Rt said on Wednesday that it would pay 5.281 billion forints to chemicals company TVK.</p>
<p>&quot;I have practically made the decision,&quot; Pal Szabo, APV General Director told a news conference.</p>
</text>
